@startuml sequence_diagram
title Sequence Diagram - Farmer Accessing Crop Cultivation Guide

actor Farmer as F
participant "Mobile App\nHome Screen" as Home
participant "Crop Selection\nScreen" as CropSelect
participant "Guide List\nScreen" as GuideList
participant "Guide Detail\nScreen" as GuideDetail
participant "Growth Stage\nScreen" as StageScreen
participant "Offline Cache" as Cache
participant "Sync Manager" as Sync
participant "Backend API" as API

== App Launch & Initial Sync ==
F -> Home: Opens App
Home -> Cache: Check cached data
alt Cache has data
    Cache --> Home: Return cached guides
else Cache empty/expired
    Home -> Sync: Trigger background sync
    Sync -> API: GET /guides/updates
    API --> Sync: Return updated guides
    Sync -> Cache: Store fresh data
    Cache --> Home: Confirm sync complete
end
Home --> F: Show home dashboard

== Browse Crops ==
F -> Home: Tap "Crop Guides"
Home -> CropSelect: Navigate
CropSelect -> Cache: GET all crops
Cache --> CropSelect: Return crop list
CropSelect --> F: Display crop categories

== Select Crop & View Guides ==
F -> CropSelect: Select "Wheat" (Rabi season)
CropSelect -> GuideList: Navigate with cropId
GuideList -> Cache: GET guides for cropId + season
Cache --> GuideList: Return matching guides
GuideList --> F: Show guide list (language variants)

== View Detailed Guide ==
F -> GuideList: Tap "Wheat Cultivation Guide - Hindi"
GuideList -> GuideDetail: Navigate with guideId
GuideDetail -> Cache: GET full guide by guideId
Cache --> GuideDetail: Return CropGuide object
GuideDetail --> F: Show overview tab

== Navigate Growth Stages ==
F -> GuideDetail: Swipe to "Growth Stages" tab
GuideDetail -> StageScreen: Navigate with guideId
StageScreen -> Cache: GET growth stages for guideId
Cache --> StageScreen: Return ordered stages
StageScreen --> F: Display stage timeline

== View Specific Stage Details ==
F -> StageScreen: Tap "Tillering Stage (Day 21-45)"
StageScreen -> Cache: GET stage details
Cache --> StageScreen: Return GrowthStage object
StageScreen --> F: Show activities, warnings, fertilizers

== View Fertilizer Schedule ==
F -> GuideDetail: Tap "Fertilizer Schedule" tab
GuideDetail -> Cache: GET fertilizer applications
Cache --> GuideDetail: Return list<FertilizerApplication>
GuideDetail --> F: Show schedule table

== View Pest Management ==
F -> GuideDetail: Tap "Pest & Disease" tab
GuideDetail -> Cache: GET pest controls
Cache --> GuideDetail: Return list<PestControl>
GuideDetail --> F: Show pest cards with symptoms/treatment

== Bookmark Guide ==
F -> GuideDetail: Tap bookmark icon
GuideDetail -> Cache: Save bookmark (farmerId, guideId)
Cache --> GuideDetail: Confirm saved
GuideDetail --> F: Show bookmark confirmation

== Offline Access (No Internet) ==
note over F, API: Farmer in field with no connectivity
F -> Home: Opens App (offline)
Home -> Cache: GET cached data
Cache --> Home: Return stale but usable data
Home --> F: Show last synced guides
F -> GuideDetail: Access cached guide
GuideDetail -> Cache: GET guide data
Cache --> GuideDetail: Return offline data
GuideDetail --> F: Display full guide (read-only)

== Background Sync When Online ==
note over F, API: Farmer returns to connectivity
F -> Home: Opens App
Home -> Sync: Auto-trigger sync
Sync -> API: GET /guides/updates?since=lastSync
API --> Sync: Return delta updates
Sync -> Cache: Update changed guides
Cache --> Sync: Confirm update
Sync --> Home: Sync complete
Home --> F: Show "New updates available" badge

@enduml